                    Drafted by McClintic, cleared by Marvin,
                    and approved by Hooper. Repeated to
                    Algiers, Tunis, Paris, and Madrid.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d11-f2" n="1" xml:id="d11-f2-content">
